 ### How many practice questions should I aim for?
 
-Aim for at least 800 unique questions across all domains, prioritizing quality over quantity. ExamOS provides scenario-based practice questions across every domain, designed to explain the rationale behind both correct and incorrect answers. Your readiness score tracks volume and coverage so you know when you have done enough.
