+- **Candidates fail by ignoring AI safety.** At 20% of the exam, safety and governance are not a footnote. Bedrock Guardrails, prompt injection defenses, and compliance frameworks show up regularly.
+- **Candidates fail by confusing on-demand and provisioned throughput.** Know the cost and latency trade-offs and when each model is justified.
